---------------------------------

Arda Governance records conceptual and algorithmic attribution for JouleWork
and Love Dynamics to Brian Roemmele's Read Multiplex publications. No upstream
prose, media, or source code from those publications is incorporated. Exact
sources, retained boundaries, and review status are documented in:

